    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">WallCarousel works completely offline: it has no internet permission, no analytics and no ads. Photos you import are copied into private app storage, which is protected by Android file-based encryption. Nothing is sent anywhere. You can export or delete everything at any time from this screen. Only the system wallpaper API is used to change the wallpaper.</string>
